  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORAD Food Security and Skills Training Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will reduce poverty and contribute to local rural development with a territorial approach. Integrating efficient and profitable agroecological and aquaculture production systems on the farms of peasants to achieve food security and improve nutrition, access to markets through the direct sale of their products, inclusion or strengthening of local networks for marketing or commercialising and contribute to the increased income.</narrative>
  </description>
